Package: quartoWidgets
Title: Quarto Widgets — Interactive Dashboard Components for Quarto HTML
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R:
    person("Pieter", "Seinen", email = "p.seinen@ggdhvb.nl",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a modular, content-agnostic set of htmltools-based
    functions to embed an interactive three-ring sunburst chart, category
    gauge, DataTables detail table, Plotly comparison plot, and TomSelect
    filter fields in standalone Quarto HTML documents. The QMD designer can
    configure filter levels, hierarchy columns, color categories, cutoffs,
    and labels. Components can be placed freely in the document; all
    JavaScript and CSS are bundled and injected automatically.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports:
    htmltools (>= 0.5.0),
    jsonlite
Suggests:
    knitr,
    sf
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
